[GameBridge][REGISTRY] === BRIDGE METHOD REGISTRY ===
[GameBridge][REGISTRY] Total methods: 87
[GameBridge][REGISTRY]   EntityManager: 8 methods
[GameBridge][REGISTRY]   PhysicsController: 7 methods
[GameBridge][REGISTRY]   TransformSystem: 5 methods
[GameBridge][REGISTRY]     - set_transform
[GameBridge][REGISTRY]     - set_position
[GameBridge][REGISTRY]     - set_rotation
[GameBridge][REGISTRY]     - set_scale
[GameBridge][REGISTRY]     - get_all_transforms
[GameBridge][REGISTRY]   VisualRenderer: 12 methods
[GameBridge][REGISTRY]   ... (etc)
[GameBridge][REGISTRY] === END REGISTRY ===
